{"ref":"BDB, מַאֲכָל","hw":"מַאֲכָל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲכָל</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:14\" href=\"/Judges.14.14\">Ju 14:14</a> (<strong>f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.16\">Hb 1:16</a>) <strong>food</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:9\" href=\"/Genesis.2.9\">Gn 2:9</a> + 21 textual; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲכַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:7\" href=\"/Genesis.40.7\">Gn 40:7</a> + 3 textual; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲכָֽלְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.10\">Ez 4:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲכָלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.16\">Hb 1:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲכָלָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.8\">Pr 6:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲכַלְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:10\" href=\"/Daniel.1.10\">Dn 1:10</a>—<em>food</em>, in genl. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:21\" href=\"/Genesis.6.21\">Gn 6:21</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.5\">1 K 10:5</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.4\">2 Ch 9:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:12\" href=\"/Haggai.2.12\">Hg 2:12</a>; opp. drink <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:7\" href=\"/Ezra.3.7\">Ezr 3:7</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.11\">2 Ch 11:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:10\" href=\"/Daniel.1.10\">Dn 1:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲכַל תַּאֲוָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 33:20\" href=\"/Job.33.20\">Jb 33:20</a>; fig. of peoples as fishes, food for Chaldeans <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.16\">Hb 1:16</a>; appl. to fruit <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:9\" href=\"/Genesis.2.9\">Gn 2:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:6\" href=\"/Genesis.3.6\">3:6</a> (of tree <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹב לְמ׳</span>) cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵץ־מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.23\">Lv 19:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.20\">Dt 20:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.25\">Ne 9:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.12\">Ez 47:12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; appl. to <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּגָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.8\">Is 62:8</a> appl.; to honey <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:14\" href=\"/Judges.14.14\">Ju 14:14</a>; to flour <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.40\">1 Ch 12:40</a>(<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:41\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.41\">41</a>), appos. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶמַח</span>; to food of ants <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.8\">Pr 6:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לָחֶם</span>); to baker’s work <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:17\" href=\"/Genesis.40.17\">Gn 40:17</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.10\">Ez 4:10</a>; appl. to carcasses, as food for beasts & birds of prey <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.26\">Dt 28:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:2\" href=\"/Psalms.79.2\">ψ 79:2</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:12\" href=\"/Psalms.44.12\">44:12</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאן מ׳</span>, sim. of suffering people) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:33\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.33\">Je 7:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.4\">16:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 19:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.19.7\">19:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 34:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.34.20\">34:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:14\" href=\"/Psalms.74.14\">ψ 74:14</a>.","next":"BDB, מַאֲכֶ֫לֶת","prev":"BDB, אֲכִילָה"}